{"title":"Career roadmap · Campaign Manager (Junior)","role":"Campaign Manager (Junior)","summary":"A Junior Campaign Manager supports political or public-policy campaigns through campaign planning, voter/audience research, field coordination, communications, digital outreach, volunteer management, events, data analysis and campaign reporting.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM","Course":"BBA – Public Policy / Political Management"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For BBA – Public Policy / Political Management, this is a strong direct alignment. The first job is usually a junior/support role; independent campaign-management responsibility normally comes after practical campaign experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Public Policy/Political Management","Political/Public Affairs Internship","Campaign Intern / Field Coordinator / Campaign Associate","Junior Campaign Manager","Campaign Manager","Senior Campaign Manager / Campaign Director","Political Strategy Director / Public Affairs Director"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build political management, public policy, campaign strategy, communication, research, field operations and data-analysis skills."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work on elections, advocacy campaigns, public-affairs projects or political consulting and develop campaign-management experience."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress to Campaign Manager, Senior Campaign Manager, Political Consultant or Public Affairs Manager."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead major political/public-policy campaigns, strategic communications, advocacy programmes or political consulting teams."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","L